   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2-year civil aviation project is a continuation of two previous projects. Development objective is to contribute to national economic growth by maintaining an aviation sector which has capacity to meet demands of passengers and airlines. Project objective is to establish a performance level were the countries have implemented international standards and are capable of managing further change themselves.</narrative>
